flowchart TD
    A[Client sends request to leader] --> B[Phase 1 Pre-Prepare: leader proposes block and sequence]
    B --> C[Replicas validate proposal and broadcast Prepare]
    C --> D[Phase 2 Prepare: collect prepare quorum]
    D --> E[Replicas broadcast Commit]
    E --> F[Phase 3 Commit: collect commit quorum]
    F --> G[Finalize and execute block]
